This fork is of Drake53's fork (https://github.com/Drake53/CSharp.lua), which makes CSharp.lua compatible with
Warcraft III Lua maps and is published as War3Net.CSharpLua and War3Net.CSharpLua.CoreSystem.

The files below were changed by mdlsvensson in 2026, from Drake53's master (v2.0.4): by a merge of yanghuan/CSharp.lua's
master (C# 11 to 14 support), and by fixes for Moonwell (https://github.com/mdlsvensson/moonwell) to collection
expressions, template properties, string escapes, nullable values made text, nullable conditionals, whole-number floats,
project references, the NuGet packages folder, lambdas, returns, primary constructors, object initializers, foreach
loops left early, continue inside a switch, fields named as a base class's private field and a float zero made an
integer in Warcraft III's Lua. Each change is in the history of the moonwell-package branch.

